    "name": "Face Your Fear",
    "steam_appid": 2762980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762980/extras/0a667e426302dd1fbc803b3c7e8653aa.poster.avif?t=1720789701\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762980/extras/0a667e426302dd1fbc803b3c7e8653aa.webm?t=1720789701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762980/extras/0a667e426302dd1fbc803b3c7e8653aa.mp4?t=1720789701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Face Your Fear</strong> is a horror game based on a story with puzzles and a realistic and stressful atmosphere. You can\u2019t fight so you have to run, hide or look death in the eyes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Face Your Fear</strong>,</h2>you incarnate a young teenager attaint of a heart disease, so you will have to pay attention to your BPM and do not forget to take your medicines.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve the puzzles as fast as possible, but do not suffer from too much stress it would be deadly...<br><br></li><li>Alone at home while your parents are gone, you find yourself seeing paranormal events and everything seems to have changed?..<br><br></li><li>All windows are blocked and unbreakable.. The phone no longer works.. You're alone in this hell, will you fight for your survival?</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game is currently in pre-alpha phase. If you encounter any issues or bugs, please report them to us on our Discord server. Your feedback is crucial to improving the game. Thank you very much!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In <strong>Face Your Fear</strong> there will be different levels, with different monsters and mechanics. Try to get out of this hell.<br><br></li><li>Immersive graphics, detailed map and stressful atmosphere.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762980/extras/0a667e426302dd1fbc803b3c7e8653aa.poster.avif?t=1720789701\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762980/extras/0a667e426302dd1fbc803b3c7e8653aa.webm?t=1720789701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762980/extras/0a667e426302dd1fbc803b3c7e8653aa.mp4?t=1720789701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Face Your Fear</strong> is a horror game based on a story with puzzles and a realistic and stressful atmosphere. You can\u2019t fight so you have to run, hide or look death in the eyes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Face Your Fear</strong>,</h2>you incarnate a young teenager attaint of a heart disease, so you will have to pay attention to your BPM and do not forget to take your medicines.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve the puzzles as fast as possible, but do not suffer from too much stress it would be deadly...<br><br></li><li>Alone at home while your parents are gone, you find yourself seeing paranormal events and everything seems to have changed?..<br><br></li><li>All windows are blocked and unbreakable.. The phone no longer works.. You're alone in this hell, will you fight for your survival?</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game is currently in pre-alpha phase. If you encounter any issues or bugs, please report them to us on our Discord server. Your feedback is crucial to improving the game. Thank you very much!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In <strong>Face Your Fear</strong> there will be different levels, with different monsters and mechanics. Try to get out of this hell.<br><br></li><li>Immersive graphics, detailed map and stressful atmosphere.</li></ul>",
